<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 331)</h2>
<p><b>Voice notes play for the whole room.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Playing a voice note now plays its audio on every seat — someone pressing ▶ in the browser is heard in the app, and playing a note in the app is heard by every browser seat. The seat that pressed play still drives the playhead; everyone else just hears it.</li>
<li>Voice notes you record in the app while a web share is active now upload their audio (end-to-end encrypted, like everything else) so browser seats can play them too — until now your voice notes reached the web as text only. Notes longer than about a minute stay local-only.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
